{"unit_id":"leolee9086__dsh-sketchup#card-zh","repo":"leolee9086/dsh-sketchup","commit":"b0342a62f8a4d6baecfca1e38638f5089ddfb9e8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH SketchUp（DSH 插件，网页与 SketchUp 桌面端）：把 SketchUp 2024 模型接入 DeepSeek Harness。它通过本机 WebSocket 将 SketchUp Ruby 扩展连接到 DSH Host，并可在 SketchUp 中打开 Harness 聊天界面。用户可读取模型快照、选择集和事件历史，按名称或类型查询实体，也可创建或删除几何、切换标签并保存模型。适合需要在 DSH 对话中检查或编辑 SketchUp 模型的建模工作流。需要安装 DSH Host 插件和 Ruby 扩展；桥接端口通过本地配置文件发现。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:109","src/tools.ts:78","ruby/dsh_sketchup_bridge/model_adapter.rb:26","ruby/dsh_sketchup_bridge/main.rb:20"]}
