{"unit_id":"leolee9086__dsh-sketchup#feature-1","repo":"leolee9086/dsh-sketchup","commit":"b0342a62f8a4d6baecfca1e38638f5089ddfb9e8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH SketchUp 的功能「读取模型快照」：读取模型元数据、顶层实体、边界和选择上下文，并可按需包含轻量几何信息。通过 DSH 的模型快照工具触发，结果为有上限的文本数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:87","src/tools.ts:90"]}
